    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag management:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Verify that the vehicle’s FASTag is active, correctly linked to the payer’s account, and positioned for easy scanning at toll plazas. For bike parcel service train routes, ensure the FASTag details are shared with the logistics partner to avoid toll‑related delays.</p>
